# Ulvenwald Behemoth's "other creatures YOU control get +1/+1 and have trample and haste": Bot2's own Llanowar Elves (cast on
# turn 4) stays a 1/1 while Bot1's Elves, cast on turn 5, is a 2/2 with trample and haste. The Behemoth has no transform ability of
# its own (! Activate on turn 3 once turned over), and when Bot2's Boomerang Basics returns it to Bot1's hand on turn 6 the Elves
# are a plain 1/1 again, without trample or haste: the bonus lasts only while it is on the battlefield.

